<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Header</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<hr/>
<p>version: 0.1.0 window_from: {{ window_from }} window_to: {{ window_to }} session_slot: {{ session_slot }} time_box_minutes: {{ time_box_minutes }} ranker_run_url: {{ ranker_run_url }}</p>
<hr/>
<h1>Header</h1>
<ul><li>window: {{ window_from }} to {{ window_to }} (PRs opened or merged in the window; never state = open)</li><li>repositories: &lt;owner/repo: public API path list at &lt;path&gt; | no API surface list&gt;</li><li>session: {{ session_slot }}; time_box_minutes {{ time_box_minutes }}; top_n &lt;n&gt;; summed_read_minutes &lt;m&gt;</li><li>signals_from_diff_only: true</li><li>review_threshold: &lt;score&gt;</li><li>previous_precision: &lt;hits&gt; of &lt;n&gt; = &lt;value&gt; (null on the first report)</li><li>weights_changed: false | true (then fill Weight change)</li></ul>
<h1>Weights</h1>
<table><thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Weight</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>modules_touched</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>public_api_delta</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>dependency_changes</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>contract_changes</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>infra_or_config_changes</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<table><thead><tr><th>Dependency kind</th><th>Weight</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>new_dependency</td><td>&lt;w, above every patch bump&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>major_bump</td><td>&lt;w, above every patch bump&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>minor_bump</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>patch_bump</td><td>&lt;w, at most 0.5&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>removal</td><td>&lt;w&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>lockfile_only</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Weight change (only when weights_changed)</h2>
<ul><li>previous_weights: &lt;the five previous values&gt;</li><li>precision_weeks_cited: &lt;at least 4&gt;; precision_values: &lt;four or more values&gt;</li></ul>
<h1>Ranked</h1>
<table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>PR</th><th>Title (context only)</th><th>Score</th><th>modules</th><th>api delta</th><th>deps</th><th>contracts</th><th>infra/config</th><th>Changed lines</th><th>Read minutes</th><th>Outcome</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>&lt;owner/repo#n&gt;</td><td>&lt;title&gt;</td><td>&lt;score&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td><td>&lt;lines&gt;</td><td>&lt;min&gt;</td><td>pending</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Deferred</h1>
<table><thead><tr><th>PR</th><th>Score</th><th>Changed lines</th><th>Read minutes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;owner/repo#n&gt;</td><td>&lt;score&gt;</td><td>&lt;lines&gt;</td><td>&lt;min&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h1>Exclusions</h1>
<table><thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>population_total</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>bot_authors</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>reverts</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>docs_only</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>generated_files</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>below_threshold</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>ranked + deferred + every exclusion count = population_total.</p>
<h1>Merged without architecture review</h1>
<table><thead><tr><th>PR</th><th>Score</th><th>Merged at</th><th>Merged by</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;owner/repo#n&gt;</td><td>&lt;score&gt;</td><td>&lt;timestamp&gt;</td><td>role:&lt;handle&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>(print &quot;none&quot; explicitly when empty)</p>
<h1>Evidence</h1>
<ul><li>{{ ranker_run_url }}</li><li>&lt;public API path list URLs&gt;</li><li>&lt;previous report URL&gt;</li></ul>
</body></html>
